*   **Show**: [mock_patient_data.json](file:///C:/Users/GSD048/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/gsd-ai-academy/docs/compliance/mock_patient_data.json).
    *   *Say*: "Here is Patricia Johnson. She doesn't exist. This is whom we train on."

### 0:25 - 0:30 | The Ask (The Manifesto)
*   **Action**: Keep VS Code open. Open [it_requirements_manifesto.md](file:///C:/Users/GSD048/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/gsd-ai-academy/docs/it/it_requirements_manifesto.md) in the side panel.
